# English message catalogue for {{ .Name }} | {{ .Name }} 的英文语言目录
#
# 与 zh-CN.yaml 的键集合一一对应：缺键会回落到默认语言，因此这里宁可留空也不删键。
# The key set matches zh-CN.yaml one to one: a missing key falls back to the default language, so a key is better left
# empty here than removed.
#
# 页面里出现的每一个 tr 键都在这份文件里：模板只写键、不写文案，因此这里少一个键，
# 那个位置就会原样显示出键名（脚手架测试会逐键核对两份目录）。
# Every tr key a page uses is present here: the templates carry keys and never copy, so a key missing here shows up as
# the key itself (the scaffold test checks the two catalogues key by key).
